    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ErfCity is a minimalist city-building puzzle game that challenges your strategic thinking and planning skills. Place buildings on a grid to gather points, but placement is key\u2014your score depends on how cleverly you position buildings near each other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each round, you'll be offered a choice of 3 random buildings to place on the grid. Choose wisely as synergies between different building types tend to drastically change you score. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An unique puzzle experience that's both relaxing and rewarding. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, how efficiently can you build your city?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-----</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ErfCity</strong> offers two unique ways to play:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Challenge Mode</strong>, you, the player  must carefully plan their city within a set number of turns, maximizing points through synergies. Every decision counts. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sandbox Mode</strong> provides a more relaxed, experimental experience, allowing  for free building placement - without restrictions. This mode is perfect for testing strategies, exploring different layouts, and simply enjoying the creative process of city-building.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ErfCity is a minimalist city-building puzzle game that challenges your strategic thinking and planning skills. Place buildings on a grid to gather points, but placement is key\u2014your score depends on how cleverly you position buildings near each other.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each round, you'll be offered a choice of 3 random buildings to place on the grid. Choose wisely as synergies between different building types tend to drastically change you score. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An unique puzzle experience that's both relaxing and rewarding. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, how efficiently can you build your city?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-----</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ErfCity</strong> offers two unique ways to play:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Challenge Mode</strong>, you, the player  must carefully plan their city within a set number of turns, maximizing points through synergies. Every decision counts. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sandbox Mode</strong> provides a more relaxed, experimental experience, allowing  for free building placement - without restrictions. This mode is perfect for testing strategies, exploring different layouts, and simply enjoying the creative process of city-building.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Build a thriving city in this minimalist puzzle game by strategically placing buildings on a grid. Choose from random building options each round and optimize placement to maximize points based on proximity and synergies.",
